From a686b6a7359af1838a376ef9ec812fd0e3f2de39 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: athexweb3 <athexweb3@nirapod.org>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:58:20 +0600
Subject: [PATCH] armv8a: add Advanced SIMD permutations and element moves

EXT, REV32, REV64, TRN1, TRN2, ZIP1, ZIP2, UZP1, UZP2 rearrange the
elements of vectors; DUP and INS from a general-purpose register or from
a vector element, and UMOV to a general-purpose register, move single
elements. Element indices are immediates checked against the number of
elements of the arrangement. The printer writes element operands as
Vn.Ts[index].
---
 changes/01-feature/armv8a-advanced-simd.md    |   2 +
 compiler/src/pp_arm_v8a.ml                    |  41 +++
 .../fail/asmgen/armv8a/vext_index_range.jazz  |   9 +
 .../fail/asmgen/armv8a/vins_index_range.jazz  |  10 +
 compiler/tests/negative.expected              |  22 +-
 compiler/tests/success/armv8a/simd_lanes.jazz |  26 ++
 eclib/JModel_armv8a.ec                        | 183 ++++++++++++
 proofs/compiler/armv8a_decl.v                 |  11 +-
 proofs/compiler/armv8a_instr_decl.v           | 270 +++++++++++++++++-
 proofs/compiler/armv8a_simd.v                 |  49 +++-
 10 files changed, 618 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 compiler/tests/fail/asmgen/armv8a/vext_index_range.jazz
 create mode 100644 compiler/tests/fail/asmgen/armv8a/vins_index_range.jazz
